{"speciesId":519,"names":{"fr":"Poichigeon","es":"Pidove","en":"Pidove","ja":"マメパト"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il suit scrupuleusement les consignes de son Dresseur, mais il a du mal à comprendre les ordres trop compliqués."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Each follows its Trainer’s orders as best it can, but they sometimes fail to understand complicated commands."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ces Pokémon vivent en ville. Ils sont peu farouches et se regroupent souvent dans les parcs ou sur les places."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"These Pokémon live in cities. They are accustomed to people. Flocks often gather in parks and plazas."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"This very forgetful Pokémon will wait for a new order from its Trainer even though it already has one."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"This very forgetful Pokémon will wait for a new order from its Trainer even though it already has one."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Un Pokémon très distrait qui oublie les ordres de son Dresseur et reste planté à en attendre de nouveaux."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Es un Pokémon muy despistado. Aunque reciba órdenes de su Entrenador, se le olvidan, y se queda esperando."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"This very forgetful Pokémon will wait for a new order from its Trainer even though it already has one."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"とても 忘れっぽい ポケモンで トレーナーに 命令 されたのに 新しい 命令を 待っている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ces Pokémon vivent en ville. Ils sont peu farouches et se regroupent souvent dans les parcs ou sur les places."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Vive en la ciudad, pues se lleva muy bien con la gente. Le encantan los parques y las plazas, donde se reúne con otros."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"These Pokémon live in cities. They are accustomed to people. Flocks often gather in parks and plazas."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"街中で 暮らしている ポケモン。 人懐っこいので 公園や 広場に たくさん 集まってくる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Un Pokémon très distrait qui oublie les ordres de son Dresseur et reste planté à en attendre de nouveaux."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Es un Pokémon muy despistado. Aunque reciba órdenes de su Entrenador, se le olvidan, y se queda esperando."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"This very forgetful Pokémon will wait for a new order from its Trainer even though it already has one."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"とても 忘れっぽい ポケモンで トレーナーに 命令 されたのに 新しい 命令を 待っている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ces Pokémon vivent en ville. Ils sont peu farouches et se regroupent souvent dans les parcs ou sur les places."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Vive en la ciudad, pues se lleva muy bien con la gente. Le encantan los parques y las plazas, donde se reúne con otros."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"These Pokémon live in cities. They are accustomed to people. Flocks often gather in parks and plazas."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"街中で 暮らしている ポケモン。 人懐っこいので 公園や 広場に たくさん 集まってくる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"On en trouve là où vivent les humains. Mieux vaut éviter de les nourrir, sous peine d’en voir arriver des centaines."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Aparece en lugares habitados por humanos. Conviene tener cuidado al darles de comer, ya que esto podría atraer a cientos de ejemplares."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Where people go, these Pokémon follow. If you’re scattering food for them, be careful— several hundred of them can gather at once."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"人の住む 場所に 現れる。 エサを まくと 何百匹でも 集まってくるので 注意だぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il n’est pas très malin et un peu distrait, mais beaucoup de Dresseurs l’apprécient pour son caractère a